<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE V ENGLAND FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE V ENGLAND FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO, Zimbabwe 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the</p>
<p>fourth day of the first test between Zimbabwe and England at</p>
<p>Queen's club on Saturday:</p>
<p>Zimbabwe first innings 376 (A.Flower 112, A.Campbell 84)</p>
<p>England first innings (overnight 306-4):</p>
<p> N.Knight lbw b Olonga		    56</p>
<p> M.Atherton lbw b P.Strang		16</p>
<p> A.Stewart lbw b P.Strang		 48</p>
<p> N.Hussain c P.Strang b Streak	 113</p>
<p> G.Thorpe c Campbell b P.Strang	 13</p>
<p> J.Crawley c A.Flower b P.Strang     112</p>
<p> R.Croft lbw b Olonga			7</p>
<p> D.Gough c G.Flower b Olonga	     2</p>
<p> C.Silverwood c Houghton b P.Strang    0</p>
<p> A.Mullally c Waller b Streak	    4</p>
<p> P.Tufnell not out			   2</p>
<p> Extras (b4 lb4 w1 nb24)		  33</p>
<p> Total					 406</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-48 2-92 3-160 4-180 5-328 6-340 7-344</p>
<p>8-353 9-378</p>
<p>Bowling: Streak 36-8-86-2 (nb13), B.Strang 17-5-54-0 (nb1),</p>
<p>P.Strang 58.4-14-123-5, Olonga 23-2-90-3 (nb9 w1), Whittall</p>
<p>10-2-25-0 (nb1), G.Flower 7-3-20-0</p>
<p>Zimbabwe second innings:</p>
<p> G.Flower lbw b Gough			 0</p>
<p> S.Carlisle c Atherton b Mullally	 4</p>
<p> A.Campbell b Croft			  29</p>
<p> D.Houghton c Croft b Tufnell	    37</p>
<p> A.Flower c Crawley b Tufnell	    14</p>
<p> A.Waller not out			    14</p>
<p> B.Strang not out			     0</p>
<p> Extras (b-2 lb-4 w-1 nb-2)		 9</p>
<p> Total (for five wickets)		 107</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-6 2-6 3-57 4-82 5-103</p>
<p>Bowling (to date): Gough 8-2-29-1 (nb1), Mullally 12-3-36-1</p>
<p>(w1), Croft 13-5-19-1, Silverwood 5-2-7-0 (nb1), Tufnell</p>
<p>7-3-10-2.</p>
